				<h3 class="cas-sub">Adaptive draft length, the within-round baseline</h3>
				<p>
					Replaying draft-length policies on the frozen exam set, a within-round entropy stop beats the
					best fixed count by +11.2% efficiency on Qwen-v1 (95% CI [+10.3%, +12.1%]), and +6.7% to +11.2%
					across the three settings. This is the number the pre-round gate is compared to above, and for
					length it wins. It is a within-round signal: it reads the drafter's uncertainty after drafting
					has begun.
				</p>
